                                                "sense_id": "65b189fd-87ff-3368-ae26-0fbcaad409e1",
                                                "text": "In English, most ordinals double as fractionals — \"third\", \"fourth\", and so on — with the exception of \"second\", whose corresponding fractional is \"half\"."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b3256ea1-8782-3a37-b1da-07da8a2ca453",
                                        "entry_id": "fe380ee6-e5dc-3219-bf71-c366925b5d7e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Partial ownership of a property, such as real estate or a chartered airplane, such that each partial owner has use of the property for only a portion of the time."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e2cde261-d427-48d4-84da-b6679edcb83e",
                                                "sense_id": "b3256ea1-8782-3a37-b1da-07da8a2ca453",
                                                "text": "A fractional is much more expensive than a traditional timeshare, but to many people, it's worth it."
                                            }
